  - ref: lib/graph_envelope.py
    owners: [C02, C10, C11]
    purpose: graph.json envelope の形検査。validator・guard・事後検出・merge driver が同じ判定を使う
  - ref: lib/guard_graph_commands.py
    owners: [C10]
    purpose: guard が Bash コマンドから graph authority への書込みを判定する解析
  - ref: lib/guard_python_writes.py
    owners: [C10]
